{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3001_p", "source_sha256": "723ac5cd6774e18c43e4b59779bad90bf4bd68f9de9040e7585ef16619ea7682", "ja": "CDの収録、お疲れさま。\nうまくいってよかったな。", "zh": "录制CD的工作真是辛苦你了。\n幸好进行得这么顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "653d27410d2c4844c9d714b8fcf6730fb3350e1c0a200694af38fc06531ac832", "ja": "そうですね。歌に関して素人同然の私が\n知ったような口をきくわけには参りませんが……", "zh": "是的，虽然在歌唱方面有如外行人的我，\n不该发表自以为是的意见……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "65a854dac827f4cc53686b8622e70af21c8e7b908c9e5397b4cfb86343210abe", "ja": "あくまで、個人的な感想としては……\nよい手応えを、感じることができたと思います。", "zh": "至少以个人的感想来说……\n我进行得可说是得心应手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3004", "source_sha256": "227353fd437d56979e6ff34b4b5a82f90cadbe2e14417b560e7134f5b2733ac1", "ja": "ほめる", "zh": "夸奖她", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3005", "source_sha256": "29d6f95f3d2168e8b77b89a6d24cc04c2c63c75edd812651265aa1efe7217026", "ja": "引き締める", "zh": "提醒她绷紧神经", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3200_p", "source_sha256": "bb97d4c502746fc1140bd19d10a172b9b3b93d8a5fa7fe1c447f6e5f17a57e2f", "ja": "それも、紬がレッスンを頑張ったからだ。\nもっと誇ってもいいと思うぞ。", "zh": "这也是因为䌷很认真上训练课程，\n这值得你更自豪一些喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3201_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a9c2ce0e5ea599edbf738c00823bd8010b8f509a2a7d165207a353228f74e111", "ja": "練習するのは当然ですから、誇ることではありません。\nですが……。そう言っていただけると、安心します。", "zh": "练习是理所当然的，不是值得自豪的事。\n但是……能听你这么说，我感到很安心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3202_051tmg", "source_sha256": "83266e0218b35d32f57050bf000dd98760d49a4f6e5bd3c6b0ce3c66fc0a0808", "ja": "今後も皆様に喜んでいただけるよう、精進しますので。\n{$P$}も、そのおつもりで……。", "zh": "为了带给大家更多喜悦，我未来会再精进自己的。\n也请{$P$}以此为目标……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3300_p", "source_sha256": "bb97d4c502746fc1140bd19d10a172b9b3b93d8a5fa7fe1c447f6e5f17a57e2f", "ja": "それも、紬がレッスンを頑張ったからだ。\nもっと誇ってもいいと思うぞ。", "zh": "这也是因为䌷很认真上训练课程，\n这值得你更自豪一些喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3301_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5f93dc6fcd8008decd78dc6b6d193d2f96ad4e6f4a05bd0b1b339c4a5524cbef", "ja": "レッスンを頑張るのは、\nできないことが多かったからなのですが……。", "zh": "努力进行训练课程，\n是因为还有很多自己做不到的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3302_051tmg", "source_sha256": "eccb9b4b35cf125a5c61242b20871daf35280a9a99ef487a0e93502289c23f7f", "ja": "お分かりになっていなかったとは驚きました。\nそうでもないと思っていたのですが……。", "zh": "我很惊讶你竟然不明白这点。\n我本以为不至于如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3303_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c07e3c2ce83d9d044c4e071638cd60d05877ef7904894fa510941516815f80f3", "ja": "やはり……あなたは、バカなのですか？", "zh": "你……果然是笨蛋吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3500_p", "source_sha256": "0e49fa174d6868232e3e862f34d248711c53ba245a5e38746e5fb2cca6544c8e", "ja": "ああ。でもこれで満足せず、\nもっともっとレベルアップしていこうな！", "zh": "是啊，但也不能就此感到满足，\n要再更加努力精进自己喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3501_051tmg", "source_sha256": "63e695140b3aeca4a470da4a70ffb61e9b7eb2203000b94fbfa8fd6caf82f435", "ja": "もちろんそのつもりです。{$P$}は、\n私がこの程度のことで、調子に乗るとお思いですか？", "zh": "我当然是这么打算的，{$P$}，\n你以为这样我就会得意忘形吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3502_p", "source_sha256": "031d76676b0b04395eb3ec037dc0374bc083a55529fd817e429249b390c54678", "ja": "いや、ただ単に、紬ならもっとレベルアップできると\n信じてるだけだよ。", "zh": "不，我纯粹只是相信䌷\n还能再更上一层楼而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3503_051tmg", "source_sha256": "14d0ecf4f45798151bfb043f4cd0b0e97dfbdb46c14083f3d0731acdd7284526", "ja": "そ、そうですか……。と、当然、そのつもりです。\nその……期待していてくださいませ。……適度に。", "zh": "这、这样吗……当、当然，我是这么打算的。\n那个……敬请……适度地期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3600_p", "source_sha256": "0e49fa174d6868232e3e862f34d248711c53ba245a5e38746e5fb2cca6544c8e", "ja": "ああ。でもこれで満足せず、\nもっともっとレベルアップしていこうな！", "zh": "是啊，但也不能就此感到满足，\n要再更加努力精进自己喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3601_051tmg", "source_sha256": "200b1bb0b612820e79c214505d624aed00035a9993ad2ed06b5bff3b798bb420", "ja": "……少し喜んだだけで、そのように人を叱りつけて。\n私には束の間の喜びすらも許さないおつもりですか？", "zh": "……只是稍微开心一下，就要被人这样责备，\n你连短暂的喜悦都不允许我拥有吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3602_p", "source_sha256": "917042e128d187d6e84db2c221cb0e60f13ba44e07b9f6ce0281b14f7c6695f8", "ja": "い、いや、そういうわけじゃなく。\nちょっと気を引き締めようかなーなんて……。", "zh": "不、不是这个意思，\n只是想让你绷紧神经一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3603_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4394a28aa5cdadec520e8be05335b0cbab9c7250673109d9d3e9ae49a2561e1c", "ja": "ならば最初から「よかったな」などと\nおっしゃらないでください。", "zh": "那请你一开始就别对我说\n「很顺利」这种话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_3604_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1dbb77b2e499791c87899bf8d2c2e73f7393e60b7bfd110253238b29f74304c4", "ja": "人を調子に乗せておいてからの、この仕打ち……。\n趣味が悪いにもほどがあるとは、このことですっ！", "zh": "先让人得意，再使出这招……\n这就是所谓的，没品也该适可而止！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
